Schäuble warns of similar riots that have broken out in France
Street fights with police, gunfights, toiled cars. Wolfgang Schäuble warns of similar riots that broke out in France.
We have to do everything we can to ensure that social dissatisfaction in Germany does not grow into violence on the street, the Federal Interior Minister calls.
